WEBVTT

01:41.570 --> 01:45.960
[Love of the Divine Tree]

01:46.539 --> 01:49.000
[Episode 39]

01:51.870 --> 01:53.640
A secret passage has to be hidden, of course.

01:53.870 --> 01:54.479
Am I

01:54.640 --> 01:55.430
supposed to install

01:55.479 --> 01:56.350
a big red-painted door here?

01:57.310 --> 01:58.000
Alright.

01:58.229 --> 01:59.590
Getting in smoothly is what matters most.

02:05.790 --> 02:06.560
This doghole really does

02:06.560 --> 02:07.790
lead directly to the main hall entrance,

02:07.980 --> 02:09.259
avoiding those shadow people outside.

02:09.590 --> 02:10.520
That imposter must be

02:10.539 --> 02:11.500
in the main hall right now.

02:12.280 --> 02:13.030
You guys handle

02:13.030 --> 02:13.800
the scum outside for me,

02:14.470 --> 02:15.870
and I go and kill that imposter. Be careful.

02:17.840 --> 02:18.560
Everyone, be careful.

02:19.120 --> 02:20.079
Don't get the blood on you.

02:20.240 --> 02:20.680
Yes.

02:27.150 --> 02:27.680
Be careful.

02:28.870 --> 02:29.190
Let's go.

02:44.430 --> 02:45.910
You actually want to kill me?

02:46.360 --> 02:47.190
If that's the case,

02:47.520 --> 02:49.190
don't blame me for showing no mercy.

03:00.150 --> 03:01.150
You impostor,

03:01.570 --> 03:02.560
I'm here today

03:02.580 --> 03:03.950
to settle the score with you!

03:27.130 --> 03:27.880
This Sun-Radiant Pearls

03:27.910 --> 03:28.910
Zeng Yi gave me

03:28.930 --> 03:29.880
are really useful.

03:30.280 --> 03:31.120
They contain

03:31.140 --> 03:32.260
the sunlight of midday.

03:32.920 --> 03:33.970
You impostors

03:34.000 --> 03:35.190
don't have shadows under the sunlight.

03:35.710 --> 03:36.560
That's because

03:36.870 --> 03:37.800
this extreme yang light

03:37.800 --> 03:39.240
weakens your spiritual power, right?

03:42.750 --> 03:43.630
Go to hell!

03:46.960 --> 03:48.150
If you dare make another move,

03:48.750 --> 03:50.120
I'll kill Tu Jiuyuan.

03:51.680 --> 03:53.360
If I die, she dies too.

03:55.520 --> 03:57.030
How do I know if she's real or fake?

03:57.570 --> 03:58.470
If she's fake,

03:59.150 --> 04:00.190
I'd be at a big loss.

04:01.240 --> 04:02.360
It's more worthwhile to kill you.

04:37.190 --> 04:37.720
Sure enough,

04:38.230 --> 04:39.350
once the source has been eliminated,

04:39.430 --> 04:40.510
the shadow people dissipated.

04:44.560 --> 04:45.120
You didn't die.

04:45.310 --> 04:45.920
You're still alive

04:46.390 --> 04:47.310
and weren't replaced.

04:49.640 --> 04:50.310
Elder Tu,

04:50.340 --> 04:50.950
are you alright?

04:58.830 --> 04:59.600
The fetus is stable.

04:59.920 --> 05:00.720
There's no major issue.

05:02.560 --> 05:03.160
It seems that

05:03.190 --> 05:05.070
when the Two-headed Deceptive Python tried to replicate you,

05:05.630 --> 05:07.120
it had no effect on the fetus in your womb.

05:07.830 --> 05:09.040
So, from beginning to end,

05:09.310 --> 05:10.510
it was unable to replicate you.

05:11.920 --> 05:12.510
Tu Jiuyuan,

05:13.000 --> 05:14.190
who allowed you to act on your own

05:14.390 --> 05:15.430
and stay by that impostor's side?

05:15.920 --> 05:17.720
You were all lovey-dovey with that impostor,

05:18.190 --> 05:18.510
and...

05:19.680 --> 05:20.270
And...

05:21.430 --> 05:23.040
about the child in your belly...

05:23.270 --> 05:24.360
This is my private matter.

05:25.000 --> 05:25.870
It's none of your business.

05:27.430 --> 05:28.600
None of my business?

05:29.070 --> 05:29.950
Then whose business is it?

05:30.630 --> 05:31.920
You've got some nerve, Tu Jiuyuan.

05:32.310 --> 05:32.920
Tell me,

05:33.120 --> 05:34.190
who has the guts?

05:35.480 --> 05:36.070
Wei Jiu,

05:36.430 --> 05:37.720
what nonsense are you talking about?

05:40.680 --> 05:42.270
The number one shadow person has been eliminated.

05:42.560 --> 05:43.630
The others who were controlling

05:43.630 --> 05:44.360
the various sects of the Heavenly Sects

05:44.520 --> 05:45.680
should have dissipated by now.

05:46.120 --> 05:46.630
The disciples of each sect

05:46.650 --> 05:47.570
have received the news

05:47.880 --> 05:48.909
and should have returned to their sects.

05:56.720 --> 05:57.560
But why haven't

05:57.560 --> 05:58.310
the spiritual channels of these major sects

05:58.330 --> 05:59.150
been closed yet?

06:03.360 --> 06:04.190
It's Wen Hongshan.

06:06.240 --> 06:06.800
What's wrong?

06:07.630 --> 06:08.750
The entrances of the Four Heavenly Sects

06:08.750 --> 06:09.480
have not opened.

06:10.050 --> 06:11.000
People from all sects are being blocked

06:11.000 --> 06:11.920
outside the barrier set by Dun Tian

06:12.270 --> 06:13.680
and cannot enter to close the spiritual channels.

06:20.040 --> 06:20.800
Do you think

06:20.800 --> 06:22.120
this is the end?

06:22.900 --> 06:24.670
No one can stop me.

06:25.390 --> 06:27.070
Three Thousand Realms Tower, rise!

06:31.830 --> 06:32.720
How could this be?

06:33.390 --> 06:33.950
The core of the formation

06:33.950 --> 06:35.040
that Dun Tian wanted to use to build the tower

06:35.040 --> 06:36.510
has already been destroyed.

06:37.240 --> 06:38.600
The Three Children are no longer in his hands.

06:39.040 --> 06:40.270
Even the shadow people

06:40.270 --> 06:41.360
he manipulated and used are gone.

06:43.430 --> 06:44.390
What else can he do?

06:44.870 --> 06:45.920
Why hasn't he stopped yet?

06:46.750 --> 06:48.430
Could it be that Dun Tian still has a backup plan

06:48.510 --> 06:49.900
we don't know about?

06:50.680 --> 06:51.310
Now,

06:51.510 --> 06:52.750
after all this effort,

06:53.430 --> 06:54.630
we still haven't reclaimed the spiritual channels.

06:55.630 --> 06:56.430
Does this mean

06:57.830 --> 07:00.190
that this fate is truly unstoppable?

07:01.240 --> 07:02.750
I don't believe in fate.

07:03.680 --> 07:05.440
Everything Shui and I have experienced in two lifetimes

07:05.950 --> 07:07.480
has long made me understand one thing:

07:08.110 --> 07:09.120
Every single prophecy

07:09.120 --> 07:10.000
recorded in the Heavenly Book

07:10.430 --> 07:12.430
can actually change.

07:13.190 --> 07:14.000
In other words,

07:14.480 --> 07:15.390
everything

07:15.630 --> 07:16.630
that everyone does

07:17.120 --> 07:18.870
leads to a corresponding result.

07:19.600 --> 07:20.720
I produced the effect because I created the cause.

07:20.920 --> 07:21.270
The path

07:21.750 --> 07:22.920
is something we forge ourselves.

07:25.440 --> 07:26.160
We still have plenty of time

07:26.190 --> 07:27.190
to change everything.

07:27.720 --> 07:29.120
It's too early to admit defeat.

07:32.830 --> 07:34.830
The priority now is to find out

07:34.850 --> 07:36.270
where Dun Tian is currently building the tower

07:36.480 --> 07:37.190
and stop him.

07:39.630 --> 07:41.040
This reminds me of something.

07:42.270 --> 07:43.159
Hundreds of years ago,

07:43.510 --> 07:44.360
the Mortal-Demon Lord tried

07:44.360 --> 07:45.430
to build the tower at Mount Scarlet Flame.

07:46.270 --> 07:46.950
There are still marks left

07:46.950 --> 07:48.360
from the spiritual power burning at that time.

07:48.750 --> 07:49.480
Perhaps we can

07:49.480 --> 07:50.430
find some other clues there.

07:52.000 --> 07:55.280
[Mount Scarlet Flame]

07:57.240 --> 07:58.480
When the Mortal-Demon Lord

07:58.480 --> 07:59.240
built the tower's core here,

07:59.680 --> 08:00.390
he must have also needed

08:00.390 --> 08:01.390
to find several spiritual channels

08:01.530 --> 08:02.650
to supply energy to it.

08:03.120 --> 08:04.310
I've looked around

08:04.720 --> 08:05.270
and there are indeed

08:05.490 --> 08:06.570
traces of mountain veins

08:06.600 --> 08:07.830
passing through the ground.

08:08.600 --> 08:09.830
Not every place

08:10.020 --> 08:11.450
can withstand the power

08:11.480 --> 08:12.360
gathered from the spiritual channels.

08:15.260 --> 08:16.090
This is an ancient scroll

08:16.120 --> 08:17.120
we found in the secret cave where the Mortal-Demon Lord

08:17.140 --> 08:17.810
cultivated in the past.

08:18.000 --> 08:18.510
Look.

08:25.430 --> 08:27.800
In this picture, there is a figure beneath the tower.

08:28.080 --> 08:28.830
What does this mean?

08:31.270 --> 08:31.950
And this one?

08:38.549 --> 08:40.360
These are the places the Mortal-Demon Lord found

08:40.559 --> 08:41.090
that could withstand

08:41.120 --> 08:42.600
the convergence of the spiritual channels.

08:42.870 --> 08:43.720
So that means

08:44.320 --> 08:45.750
if Dun Tian wants to build the Three Thousand Realms Tower,

08:46.080 --> 08:47.670
the the tower's core can only be in these few locations.

08:48.030 --> 08:49.270
If we split up and investigate now,

08:49.630 --> 08:50.360
do we still have time?

08:51.550 --> 08:52.000
The Mortal-Demon Lord

08:52.030 --> 08:53.630
chose Mount Scarlet Flame back then.

08:53.910 --> 08:54.600
And Dun Tian originally

08:54.630 --> 08:55.600
chose Puxin Village.

08:56.270 --> 08:57.030
Aside from

08:57.030 --> 08:58.320
their abundant spiritual energy,

08:58.840 --> 08:59.960
what do these two places have in common?

09:00.790 --> 09:02.000
The south of Scarlet River

09:02.390 --> 09:03.360
and the east of Mount Ying.

09:03.750 --> 09:04.550
Ancient texts record

09:04.960 --> 09:06.510
that the First God created nine voids,

09:07.080 --> 09:07.960
and among the nine voids,

09:08.030 --> 09:09.480
there are Scarlet River and Mount Ying.

09:10.080 --> 09:11.560
Mount Scarlet Flame and Puxin Village

09:11.910 --> 09:13.030
happen to be located precisely

09:13.030 --> 09:14.870
on the southeast positions of Scarlet River and Mount Ying.

09:15.400 --> 09:16.640
There's only one place

09:16.670 --> 09:18.150
that can withstand the convergence

09:18.610 --> 09:19.210
of the spiritual channels

09:19.240 --> 09:20.550
and is located in the southeast position

09:21.080 --> 09:21.870
of one of the voids—

09:22.550 --> 09:23.150
Mount Wester.

09:26.260 --> 09:27.690
Dun Tian plans to build the Three Thousand Realms Tower

09:27.720 --> 09:28.720
on our Mount Wester?

09:29.270 --> 09:30.360
So it's not for the spiritual channel.

09:30.840 --> 09:32.150
It's to use it as the foundation for the tower's core.

09:36.910 --> 09:37.390
Ranran,

09:38.030 --> 09:38.960
Qing Luo has disappeared.

09:39.320 --> 09:40.510
Last time, you warned me

09:40.710 --> 09:42.710
that Dun Tian might try to seize the Dragon's child,

09:43.390 --> 09:44.600
and I immediately went to summon him.

09:44.960 --> 09:46.630
But he had slipped out of Dragon Island.

09:47.560 --> 09:48.630
I searched for a long time

09:49.270 --> 09:50.270
and found that his Dragon Breath

09:50.690 --> 09:52.050
had vanished at the edge

09:52.080 --> 09:52.750
of the Sea of Immortality.

09:53.120 --> 09:54.240
I've searched everywhere,

09:55.120 --> 09:56.320
but there's no trace of him.

09:58.000 --> 09:58.440
Zeng Yi,

09:58.850 --> 09:59.450
take the disciples back

09:59.480 --> 10:01.000
to the vicinity of Mount Wester to check the situation.

10:01.440 --> 10:02.270
Find more people to help.

10:02.670 --> 10:03.600
Don't act rashly for now.

10:04.120 --> 10:04.750
Ranran and I will go to

10:04.750 --> 10:05.960
the edge of the Sea of Immortality to investigate.

10:06.210 --> 10:06.960
Once we find Qing Luo,

10:07.120 --> 10:07.960
we will meet you at Mount Wester.

10:08.200 --> 10:08.600
Okay.

10:09.510 --> 10:10.750
I'll go to Mount Wester with you.

10:11.270 --> 10:12.080
You're pregnant.

10:12.240 --> 10:13.080
Why are you going there?

10:14.350 --> 10:16.160
There are no dry decks when the ship is sinking.

10:16.620 --> 10:17.570
If the whole world

10:17.600 --> 10:18.270
were to be overturned,

10:18.380 --> 10:19.690
what would be the use of me staying here

10:19.720 --> 10:20.480
on Mount Scarlet Flame, doing nothing?

10:22.150 --> 10:22.510
Alright.

10:23.000 --> 10:24.000
Let's split up.

10:25.210 --> 10:27.160
[Sea of Immortality]

10:29.790 --> 10:30.870
By the Sea of Immortality,

10:31.200 --> 10:32.200
this is the only strange place.

10:33.360 --> 10:34.510
Could that blood mist be…

10:34.960 --> 10:36.200
The blood mist formed from the flood dragon pearls

10:36.720 --> 10:38.240
is the most coveted delicacy of the Dragon Clan.

10:39.870 --> 10:40.960
Qing Luo is here.

10:53.440 --> 10:54.030
It's you.

10:55.000 --> 10:56.550
Since you've found your way here,

10:57.470 --> 10:58.830
why are you sneaking around?

11:00.960 --> 11:02.360
You want to ruin my big plan?

11:02.720 --> 11:03.510
Wu,

11:04.150 --> 11:05.270
look at yourself.

11:05.790 --> 11:07.240
The demonic energy that Dun Tian lent you before

11:07.390 --> 11:08.320
has already invaded your flesh and blood.

11:08.600 --> 11:09.970
You'll definitely fall into demonic ways.

11:10.360 --> 11:11.150
Stop now.

11:11.270 --> 11:12.200
Wang Suizhi!

11:13.390 --> 11:15.030
Today is the deadline.

11:15.650 --> 11:16.600
If I don't send the little Green Dragon away,

11:16.630 --> 11:17.870
I'll die!

11:18.510 --> 11:19.870
Yet you're still here talking nonsense!

11:20.360 --> 11:20.910
No.

11:22.290 --> 11:23.370
You'll be fine.

11:24.430 --> 11:25.000
I told you

11:25.030 --> 11:26.550
I could help you break the Life-Death Spell.

11:33.580 --> 11:35.150
How did the Life-Death Spell that was cast on me

11:36.080 --> 11:37.550
transfer to you?

11:39.200 --> 11:39.670
You...

11:40.680 --> 11:41.800
How did you manage to do that?

11:42.790 --> 11:44.750
As an unqualified cultivator,

11:45.270 --> 11:46.750
the only skill I'm good at

11:48.000 --> 11:49.080
is manipulating fate.

11:57.960 --> 11:58.750
Wu,

11:59.600 --> 12:00.750
I know these years

12:01.510 --> 12:02.600
have been difficult for you.

12:04.230 --> 12:05.560
Let me bear the pain

12:06.960 --> 12:08.360
of the Life-Death Spell for you.

12:19.080 --> 12:20.670
You shortened your lifespan

12:21.270 --> 12:23.150
to swap your fate with mine.

12:23.960 --> 12:25.360
When the Life-Death Spell strikes,

12:25.480 --> 12:26.150
you will...

12:26.960 --> 12:28.320
You don't need to borrow demonic energy anymore,

12:29.120 --> 12:30.910
and you don't need to be controlled by Dun Tian from now on.

12:31.670 --> 12:32.320
Wu,

12:32.790 --> 12:33.720
release the Green Dragon.

12:34.030 --> 12:34.870
The world is vast.

12:35.100 --> 12:36.480
There are so many interesting places

12:37.080 --> 12:38.320
worth seeing.

12:40.510 --> 12:41.150
Wu!

12:41.630 --> 12:44.150
Who gave you the permission to make the decision on your own?

12:45.200 --> 12:46.270
Release the Green Dragon

12:46.680 --> 12:48.440
and let you die in my place?

12:48.900 --> 12:49.940
And then what?

12:51.510 --> 12:52.360
Wang Suizhi,

12:53.120 --> 12:53.790
and then,

12:54.390 --> 12:56.000
are you going to leave me alone?

12:57.630 --> 12:58.550
I won't accept it!

12:59.360 --> 13:00.670
If you continue like this,

13:01.390 --> 13:03.120
you'll be corrupted by demonic energy

13:03.600 --> 13:04.840
and lose yourself forever.

13:05.080 --> 13:06.240
So what?

13:09.750 --> 13:10.600
All these years,

13:12.000 --> 13:13.440
you're the only one who has always stayed

13:14.320 --> 13:15.150
by my side.

13:16.840 --> 13:18.080
All the way

13:18.750 --> 13:19.550
till now,

13:20.720 --> 13:22.150
I only have you left.

13:25.140 --> 13:26.170
I will never

13:26.200 --> 13:27.360
let the Life-Death Spell strike.

13:28.270 --> 13:30.120
I will send the Green Dragon to Dun Tian,

13:30.750 --> 13:31.750
and then let you

13:32.550 --> 13:34.030
live on with me!

13:35.910 --> 13:36.840
Wu!

13:53.420 --> 13:54.150
Wu.

13:55.620 --> 13:56.550
She's about to fall into demonic ways.

13:57.120 --> 13:57.750
Master,

13:58.030 --> 13:59.360
Wu has absorbed too much demonic energy.

13:59.430 --> 14:00.360
Please save her!

14:03.080 --> 14:03.840
Qingge,

14:04.840 --> 14:05.910
you came after all.

14:06.550 --> 14:07.030
What now?

14:07.280 --> 14:08.640
are you going to put on airs again

14:08.670 --> 14:10.270
and lecture me from your high horse?

14:10.630 --> 14:11.270
Wu,

14:11.960 --> 14:13.200
I heard about Suizhi

14:13.270 --> 14:14.150
and the Life-Death Spell.

14:14.580 --> 14:15.770
Stop the formation for now,

14:16.200 --> 14:17.150
and let's think of a way together.

14:17.630 --> 14:18.550
There must be a solution.

14:18.790 --> 14:20.240
I don't need your solutions!

14:22.550 --> 14:23.960
From the past until now,

14:24.670 --> 14:25.910
whenever you look at me,

14:26.360 --> 14:27.720
it always feels like you're giving me charity.

14:28.320 --> 14:29.200
I don't want your charity!

14:31.630 --> 14:32.430
This time,

14:33.510 --> 14:35.120
I will save Suizhi myself.

14:36.150 --> 14:37.200
The Three Thousand Realms.

14:39.140 --> 14:39.840
I'm going to

14:39.870 --> 14:41.390
the Three Thousand Realms with him,

14:42.030 --> 14:43.510
becoming the master of the Heavenly Sects

14:44.080 --> 14:45.840
and trampling you underfoot.

14:54.360 --> 14:54.790
Oh no.

14:55.120 --> 14:56.200
The little Green Dragon has been sent away.

14:57.120 --> 14:57.870
Wu!

15:05.620 --> 15:06.670
She has completely fallen into demonic ways.

15:07.000 --> 15:08.000
There's only killing intent left in her heart.

15:08.600 --> 15:09.320
With this blood-colored totem,

15:09.320 --> 15:10.240
she will self-destruct,

15:10.550 --> 15:11.550
killing all living beings here,

15:11.840 --> 15:12.960
including herself.

15:27.200 --> 15:27.840
Wu,

15:28.510 --> 15:29.910
I can't let you hurt yourself,

15:30.270 --> 15:31.600
nor can I let you hurt Master.

15:32.270 --> 15:33.630
This is the last thing

15:34.630 --> 15:35.790
I can do for you.

15:39.000 --> 15:39.600
Suizhi,

15:39.910 --> 15:40.840
are you going to scatter your heart?

15:44.830 --> 15:45.630
Master,

15:46.360 --> 15:47.240
Wu...

15:48.120 --> 15:49.360
will definitely turn back!

16:03.360 --> 16:04.080
Suizhi?

16:04.870 --> 16:05.440
Suizhi!

16:11.360 --> 16:12.000
Suizhi!

16:13.630 --> 16:14.440
Wu,

16:15.840 --> 16:16.790
you're alright.

16:18.120 --> 16:18.870
That's great.

16:20.750 --> 16:22.030
Why are you so foolish?

16:24.270 --> 16:24.910
Why did you

16:26.030 --> 16:27.480
sacrifice your life for me?

16:29.440 --> 16:30.670
I observe fate.

16:32.270 --> 16:33.790
All my life, I've sought profit and avoided harm.

16:35.550 --> 16:36.630
But when I met you,

16:37.270 --> 16:38.030
I realized that

16:39.000 --> 16:40.510
when we meet the ones we love,

16:41.910 --> 16:43.630
even a brief moment of closeness

16:45.360 --> 16:47.120
is enough to cherish for a lifetime.

16:49.440 --> 16:49.790
No.

16:50.480 --> 16:51.390
I will save you.

16:51.840 --> 16:52.840
I will save you!

16:53.720 --> 16:54.480
Why?

16:55.790 --> 16:56.600
Dun Tian,

16:57.280 --> 16:58.480
lend me your demonic energy!

16:58.510 --> 16:59.440
Dun Tian!

17:02.150 --> 17:02.550
No.

17:03.200 --> 17:03.750
Suizhi,

17:04.500 --> 17:06.130
I'll go and beg Dun Tian again.

17:06.160 --> 17:07.270
I will think of a way!

17:07.290 --> 17:09.349
I will find a way!

17:09.369 --> 17:10.720
I will think of a way!

17:11.400 --> 17:12.069
Wu,

17:13.400 --> 17:14.670
don't waste energy for me,

17:15.829 --> 17:17.550
and don't go to Dun Tian.

17:18.440 --> 17:19.440
All I wish

17:20.440 --> 17:21.960
is that you can stay away from all of this

17:22.880 --> 17:25.680
and live a peaceful life.

17:33.750 --> 17:34.590
Master,

17:35.960 --> 17:36.880
I'm an unfilial disciple

17:37.640 --> 17:38.750
and have disappointed you.

17:40.270 --> 17:41.790
But I beg you,

17:43.030 --> 17:44.590
please forgive Wu.

17:46.000 --> 17:47.350
She has lost all her spiritual power

17:47.920 --> 17:49.030
and can't do anything anymore.

17:50.550 --> 17:51.310
Just let her

17:52.310 --> 17:54.030
live the rest of her life

17:55.030 --> 17:56.030
as an ordinary person.

17:57.880 --> 17:59.110
If there is a next life,

18:00.480 --> 18:01.880
I will serve you

18:02.810 --> 18:04.480
to repay your kindness.

18:09.240 --> 18:10.240
Even if you hadn't said it,

18:11.030 --> 18:12.350
she was, after all, my sister in a past life.

18:13.310 --> 18:13.720
You...

18:14.750 --> 18:15.680
don't need to worry.

18:23.590 --> 18:24.350
Wu,

18:26.070 --> 18:26.790
let me

18:28.130 --> 18:29.890
read your fortune one last time.

18:37.310 --> 18:37.830
The rest of your life

18:39.640 --> 18:40.350
will be peaceful

18:41.160 --> 18:41.880
and happy.

18:48.200 --> 18:48.920
Very good.

18:53.830 --> 18:54.680
Very good.

19:02.750 --> 19:09.460
♫Who knows the loneliness of mountains and seas?♫

19:07.960 --> 19:08.720
Suizhi!

19:09.110 --> 19:09.830
Suizhi!

19:09.760 --> 19:16.090
♫The sharp wind cuts at my heart♫

19:11.070 --> 19:11.960
Suizhi!

19:12.110 --> 19:15.590
Wang Suizhi! Wang Suizhi!

19:16.500 --> 19:20.040
♫Hold a drop of blood♫

19:17.400 --> 19:18.480
Suizhi!

19:20.030 --> 19:20.960
Suizhi!

19:20.430 --> 19:24.200
♫Tattered flowers and tears♫

19:23.160 --> 19:23.830
Suizhi!

19:24.570 --> 19:30.160
♫Reincarnating but to no avail♫

19:25.350 --> 19:28.270
Wang Suizhi! Wang Suizhi!

19:28.400 --> 19:29.880
Wang Suizhi!

19:30.900 --> 19:37.510
♫Devoting one's life despite knowing it can't be♫

19:31.880 --> 19:33.070
Do you remember that

19:34.680 --> 19:35.880
25 years ago,

19:37.160 --> 19:38.790
you saved me at the foot of Mount Wester?

19:38.030 --> 19:44.100
♫Coming to the abyss despite knowing retreat is possible♫

19:40.200 --> 19:41.550
I was not a talented cultivator

19:42.200 --> 19:43.480
and was bullied by my senior brothers.

19:44.590 --> 19:46.000
You stood up for me.

19:44.900 --> 19:48.390
♫Who says the world is full of wrongs?♫

19:48.510 --> 19:49.720
So what if you're not talented?

19:48.510 --> 19:52.170
♫I seize the Way and choose heaven♫

19:50.030 --> 19:51.030
If your hands are so idle,

19:51.200 --> 19:52.000
I'll chop them all off for you.

19:53.140 --> 19:59.850
♫It won't be a waste of my life to burn until I wither♫

19:58.440 --> 19:59.960
I thought you were a disciple of the Wester Sect,

20:00.270 --> 20:01.480
so I joined the Wester Sect.

20:00.580 --> 20:03.290
♫There's no need to discuss right or wrong♫

20:02.000 --> 20:03.160
I'm really grateful to you.

20:03.490 --> 20:07.150
♫I can sacrifice my life♫

20:07.550 --> 20:10.430
♫All rules can be dismantled♫

20:10.680 --> 20:14.220
♫Die in this world♫

20:14.970 --> 20:18.540
♫The masses spread rumors that are hard to swallow♫

20:17.550 --> 20:18.880
Every time you came to Mount Wester,

20:19.170 --> 20:21.990
♫I haven't said anything yet, my heart is clear♫

20:19.720 --> 20:20.680
I was so happy

20:21.790 --> 20:22.790
to see you.

20:22.520 --> 20:28.500
♫I still don't regret it; I'll pay for it all my life♫

20:27.000 --> 20:28.030
I've always hoped

20:28.910 --> 20:31.780
♫You know my heart, won't go against my wishes♫

20:29.960 --> 20:31.590
that you could live a happier life.

20:31.860 --> 20:35.390
♫Don't speak of redressing injustices♫

20:33.440 --> 20:34.160
Master,

20:35.790 --> 20:37.070
do you have any clues about Wu's whereabouts?

20:35.830 --> 20:38.150
♫Don't let others pity me♫

20:38.110 --> 20:39.070
Why are you looking for her?

20:38.180 --> 20:42.630
♫Try your best to forget me♫

20:40.920 --> 20:42.640
Why?

20:43.220 --> 20:46.640
♫I'll go through hardships and never break down♫

20:43.270 --> 20:46.680
Why? Why?

20:47.210 --> 20:50.390
♫I vow to fight against darkness♫

20:49.640 --> 20:50.720
In my heart,

20:50.670 --> 20:57.090
♫Love punishes me a thousand times, yet a merciful heart pardons me♫

20:53.260 --> 20:54.500
compared to anyone,

20:56.790 --> 20:58.440
you have always been the best.

20:57.410 --> 21:00.610
♫No pain, no resentment♫

21:13.270 --> 21:14.120
Suizhi.

21:23.350 --> 21:24.200
Immortals?

21:26.640 --> 21:27.440
Immortals?

21:30.030 --> 21:31.790
So many immortals.

21:32.830 --> 21:33.720
Immortals.

21:35.400 --> 21:37.720
I'll find immortals to save Suizhi.

21:38.240 --> 21:38.960
Immortals.

21:40.560 --> 21:42.200
So many immortals.

21:42.220 --> 21:42.900
Immortals.

21:57.750 --> 21:58.590
Wu...

21:59.720 --> 22:00.880
has lost her sanity.

22:05.030 --> 22:05.830
With the demonic energy entering her body,

22:06.680 --> 22:07.400
she was supposed to become

22:07.400 --> 22:08.680
a bloodthirsty and murderous Mortal-Demon.

22:10.070 --> 22:11.350
But now that she has lost her sanity,

22:11.920 --> 22:12.960
she's immune to being controlled.

22:13.960 --> 22:15.240
It's a blessing in disguise.

22:31.390 --> 22:32.350
The demonic clouds are gathering in the sky.

22:33.030 --> 22:34.000
The anomaly is...

22:34.640 --> 22:36.160
The Three Thousand Realms Tower is about to form.

22:38.480 --> 22:39.070
How could this be?

22:40.030 --> 22:40.680
Ranran.

22:42.440 --> 22:43.030
Su Yishui.

22:43.590 --> 22:44.160
Ranran.

22:45.880 --> 22:46.310
I followed the compass

22:46.310 --> 22:47.510
you left behind

22:47.720 --> 22:48.830
and finally found you.

22:49.350 --> 22:50.070
Su Yu

22:50.270 --> 22:51.240
was taken away by Dun Tian.

22:52.010 --> 22:53.080
The surroundings of Qiongqi Village

22:53.110 --> 22:54.160
are covered by a hidden barrier.

22:54.720 --> 22:55.880
How did Dun Tian find him?

22:56.650 --> 22:57.560
It was His Highness

22:58.200 --> 22:59.440
who walked out of the barrier on his own.

23:00.310 --> 23:00.790
Come, look.

23:00.960 --> 23:01.920
These vegetables have grown so well.

23:02.070 --> 23:03.350
Thank you, Auntie.

23:03.510 --> 23:04.510
What a bountiful harvest!

23:04.590 --> 23:05.240
It's too much.

23:05.270 --> 23:06.310
We can't finish them in the next few days.

23:08.250 --> 23:09.170
Are you going to the market?

23:09.200 --> 23:10.200
Yes, we're going to the market

23:10.680 --> 23:11.510
to take a look around.

23:12.000 --> 23:12.440
We're off then.

23:12.510 --> 23:12.880
Alright.

23:14.160 --> 23:15.480
It's absolutely true.

23:15.640 --> 23:17.030
I saw the notice with my own eyes.

23:17.240 --> 23:19.480
Minister Zhou was arrested

23:19.720 --> 23:20.780
and charged with

23:21.070 --> 23:22.480
the serious crime of kidnapping the Crown Prince.

23:22.600 --> 23:23.510
And he'll be executed soon.

23:23.880 --> 23:25.310
This minister has always been a loyal official.

23:25.830 --> 23:27.000
How could he kidnap the Crown Prince?

23:27.030 --> 23:27.590
I think

23:28.000 --> 23:28.830
it's a setup.

23:29.640 --> 23:30.510
Speaking of which,

23:30.640 --> 23:32.110
it's all because the Crown Prince is missing

23:32.460 --> 23:33.130
that the capital

23:33.160 --> 23:34.270
is in such chaos.

24:32.470 --> 24:33.110
Your Highness,

24:34.030 --> 24:35.110
so you're here.

24:39.720 --> 24:41.240
I was planning to return with you anyway.

24:42.740 --> 24:43.890
There's no need to make things difficult for Minister Zhou.

24:44.160 --> 24:44.920
Let him go.

24:45.550 --> 24:46.720
Your Highness, I've been searching for you for days.

24:47.840 --> 24:48.840
I know

24:49.590 --> 24:50.750
we're on the same page.

24:53.350 --> 24:53.960
Now,

24:54.440 --> 24:55.240
Su Yi and Qing Luo

24:55.240 --> 24:56.590
have both fallen into his hands.

24:57.390 --> 24:58.340
But what about the Demon's child?

24:58.980 --> 25:00.380
The Demon's child no longer exists.

25:01.070 --> 25:02.000
The Child of the Human Emperor,

25:02.070 --> 25:02.960
the Child of the Divine Dragon,

25:03.310 --> 25:04.070
and the Child of the True Devil.

25:04.720 --> 25:05.720
The Three Children are all here.

25:06.880 --> 25:08.310
The strange phenomenon of the Three Thousand Realms Tower

25:08.640 --> 25:09.310
is the proof.

25:12.880 --> 25:13.550
Feihua,

25:14.830 --> 25:15.880
may I ask you for a favor?

25:17.270 --> 25:18.720
Wu has lost all her cultivation

25:19.110 --> 25:20.070
and her sanity.

25:20.880 --> 25:22.550
Please take her to Qiongqi Village.

25:23.440 --> 25:23.880
Alright.

25:25.270 --> 25:25.960
So,

25:26.270 --> 25:27.200
where are you going?

25:28.030 --> 25:28.750
Back to Mount Wester.

25:29.400 --> 25:30.030
We need to save Mount Wester

25:30.030 --> 25:31.440
before the Three Thousand Realms Tower

25:31.720 --> 25:32.550
is fully formed,

25:34.110 --> 25:35.110
and save this world as well.

25:45.310 --> 25:46.270
Master, Ranran.

25:48.200 --> 25:49.920
This strange phenomenon of the Three Thousand Realms Tower in the sky…

25:50.680 --> 25:51.200
It seems

25:51.660 --> 25:52.900
your trip to rescue the little Green Dragon

25:53.070 --> 25:54.110
was in vain.

25:54.960 --> 25:55.640
What happened?

25:56.070 --> 25:57.200
Ranran, Master,

25:57.440 --> 25:58.480
the entrance to the Wester Sect

25:58.790 --> 26:00.110
is sealed by Dun Tian with a barrier.

26:00.280 --> 26:01.320
It's the same kind of barrier as the ones that

26:01.350 --> 26:02.440
seal the spiritual channels of the Four Heavenly Sects.

26:02.680 --> 26:03.270
We can't break through it.

26:03.480 --> 26:04.400
If we delay any longer,

26:04.720 --> 26:05.400
the Three Thousand Realms Tower

26:05.400 --> 26:06.200
will be fully formed.

26:06.790 --> 26:07.510
This barrier

26:07.630 --> 26:08.740
was set by the power from the Immortal Realm.

26:09.160 --> 26:10.590
Once you step in, heavenly thunder will strike.

26:11.470 --> 26:12.360
We can't even take a step in.

26:15.160 --> 26:16.200
To break through an Immortal Realm barrier,

26:16.350 --> 26:17.700
we need the power from the Immortal Realm.

26:18.160 --> 26:19.400
The power of the Immortal Realm?

26:20.240 --> 26:21.550
But we are all mortals.

26:21.750 --> 26:23.030
Where can we get the power from the Immortal Realm?

26:24.070 --> 26:24.480
We have it.

26:25.640 --> 26:26.830
Where did you get the power from the Immortal Realm?

26:30.830 --> 26:31.710
This Heavenly Book

26:31.750 --> 26:32.920
is originally a treasure from the Immortal Realm.

26:33.310 --> 26:34.510
This fragment of the Heavenly Book

26:34.720 --> 26:35.960
still retains some residual immortal power.

26:36.350 --> 26:37.280
We can use this

26:37.310 --> 26:38.640
to pass through Dun Tian's barrier.

26:39.590 --> 26:40.950
You actually have the Heavenly Book?

26:42.160 --> 26:43.680
Even just a small piece of this thing

26:44.030 --> 26:45.160
is a priceless treasure.

26:46.030 --> 26:46.720
If you destroy it,

26:46.720 --> 26:47.790
won't that be a terrible waste?

26:48.400 --> 26:49.350
It's a critical moment.

26:49.970 --> 26:51.120
Should we keep the Heavenly Book

26:51.320 --> 26:52.600
and die with it?

26:54.720 --> 26:55.720
Wait for my news.

27:00.400 --> 27:01.400
You want to face death

27:01.400 --> 27:02.030
alone again?

27:02.590 --> 27:03.480
What about me?

27:04.680 --> 27:06.240
But the remaining power of the Heavenly Book isn't enough.

27:07.070 --> 27:07.640
It's safer

27:08.070 --> 27:08.720
if one person does it.

27:09.350 --> 27:10.720
Then why don't you let me go alone?

27:11.680 --> 27:12.880
You won't have a second chance

27:12.880 --> 27:13.680
to leave me behind

27:13.710 --> 27:14.430
and face danger on your own.

27:14.960 --> 27:15.830
If we're going, we go together.

27:16.350 --> 27:17.400
But two people

27:17.790 --> 27:18.920
will consume more power.

27:19.430 --> 27:20.860
Once the Heavenly Book's power is exhausted…

27:21.030 --> 27:22.400
Do you remember the Death Realm at Wangxiang Pass?

27:22.960 --> 27:23.790
Back then, the two of us—

27:23.920 --> 27:25.160
one expelled the impurities, the other brought in the new.

27:25.480 --> 27:26.550
Our spiritual power circulated as if we were one.

27:27.270 --> 27:28.400
This time, we'll use the same method.

27:45.770 --> 27:49.410
♫For you, I dare to face a thousand arrows♫

27:49.440 --> 27:52.410
♫My spiritual sense returning to nothingness, and my Spirit Root scattering♫

27:52.730 --> 27:56.390
♫Even if I must die, I will use the last piece♫

27:56.730 --> 27:59.710
♫Of my broken body to protect you♫

28:16.310 --> 28:16.750
Oh no.

28:17.070 --> 28:18.110
That's the Three Thousand Realms Tower!

28:18.910 --> 28:19.980
The Three Thousand Realms Tower has formed?

28:53.550 --> 28:54.310
-Master!
-Master!

28:54.960 --> 28:55.550
Shui,

28:56.110 --> 28:57.440
we're about to pass through the barrier.

29:13.680 --> 29:14.720
Tu Jiuyuan, what are you doing?

29:14.990 --> 29:15.650
You're pregnant.

29:15.680 --> 29:16.550
Why are you getting involved in this mess?

29:16.900 --> 29:18.270
If no one can stop Dun Tian,

29:18.680 --> 29:19.920
how much longer can we survive?

29:56.770 --> 29:57.790
I didn't expect the overflowing Space-Time Power

29:57.790 --> 29:59.000
of the Three Thousand Realms Tower

29:59.310 --> 30:00.070
to be so powerful.

30:00.720 --> 30:01.510
If this continues,

30:01.770 --> 30:02.610
before Dun Tian sacrifices the world,

30:02.640 --> 30:03.790
the entire earth will collapse.

30:04.070 --> 30:05.920
Master and Ranran are fighting desperately inside.

30:06.270 --> 30:07.550
As a disciple of the Wester Sect,

30:07.960 --> 30:08.960
I must also

30:08.960 --> 30:09.830
contribute my strength!

30:14.310 --> 30:15.240
Before Master and Ranran

30:15.240 --> 30:16.230
stop Dun Tian,

30:16.650 --> 30:18.480
let's protect the mortal world!

30:30.550 --> 30:31.270
Uncle Master?

30:32.550 --> 30:33.510
All the Heavenly Ones

30:33.790 --> 30:34.710
who could come are here.

30:34.990 --> 30:36.160
This evil, monstrous thing

30:36.310 --> 30:37.510
is delaying my drinking!

30:37.890 --> 30:38.800
Let's handle the important thing first.

30:39.350 --> 30:40.070
You need to survive

30:40.330 --> 30:41.930
to drink your wine.

30:47.160 --> 30:48.350
Use your magical weapons

30:48.480 --> 30:49.720
to resist the overflowing power

30:49.740 --> 30:50.800
of the Three Thousand Realms Tower!

30:57.680 --> 30:58.550
Fellow cultivators,

30:59.270 --> 31:01.570
the demons are wreaking havoc, and the world is in chaos.

31:01.590 --> 31:02.670
As cultivators,

31:03.160 --> 31:04.160
what should we do?

31:04.350 --> 31:07.030
Hold our swords and protect the world! Even if we die, we'll have no regrets!

31:07.400 --> 31:10.640
Hold our swords and protect the world! Even if we die, we'll have no regrets!

31:15.640 --> 31:16.400
The space-time turbulence

31:16.480 --> 31:17.510
caused me to take so long to land.

31:18.310 --> 31:18.880
Are you alright?

31:19.310 --> 31:19.750
I'm fine.

31:21.270 --> 31:21.880
Are you alright?

31:22.640 --> 31:23.160
I'm fine.

31:25.590 --> 31:26.270
How did Mount Wester

31:26.960 --> 31:28.240
become like this?

31:28.680 --> 31:30.270
This is a new space created by the Three Thousand Realms Tower,

31:30.750 --> 31:32.430
attached to Mount Wester.

31:33.160 --> 31:34.270
I'm afraid Mount Wester

31:35.080 --> 31:36.280
has already been destroyed beyond recognition

31:36.310 --> 31:37.270
by the space-time turbulence.

31:37.830 --> 31:38.960
Withered trees can sprout again,

31:39.480 --> 31:40.510
and broken houses can be rebuilt.

31:41.270 --> 31:42.270
As long as we're all here,

31:42.850 --> 31:43.930
everything can be started anew.

31:45.550 --> 31:46.200
We somehow

31:46.200 --> 31:47.440
ended up in this hellish place.

31:47.640 --> 31:48.400
How do we get back?

31:49.440 --> 31:50.590
We're here to stop Dun Tian.

31:51.240 --> 31:52.070
Why should we go back?

31:52.590 --> 31:53.640
Stop joking.

31:54.480 --> 31:55.270
The Three Thousand Realms Tower

31:55.400 --> 31:56.960
is an evil being that even immortals can't deal with.

31:57.160 --> 31:58.920
When the tower hadn't formed, there might have been a way.

31:59.440 --> 32:00.480
Now that the tower has formed,

32:00.640 --> 32:01.510
what can we do?

32:02.240 --> 32:02.720
That's right.

32:03.550 --> 32:04.350
Now that things have come to this point,

32:04.680 --> 32:05.550
how can we give up?

32:06.350 --> 32:07.350
It's just one last fight.

32:09.520 --> 32:10.450
Sovereign Wei,

32:10.480 --> 32:11.510
thank you for your help earlier.

32:11.750 --> 32:12.720
Please stay here

32:13.000 --> 32:14.000
and wait for our news.

32:32.510 --> 32:34.590
It created four identical worlds.

32:35.440 --> 32:36.640
It's the infancy of the Three Thousand Realms.

32:37.350 --> 32:38.510
If it's left to grow,

32:38.880 --> 32:40.160
more and more such worlds will appear,

32:40.550 --> 32:41.880
eventually breaking through this space

32:42.200 --> 32:43.240
and extending to the outside world.

32:43.790 --> 32:45.270
The road to the Three Thousand Realms Tower

32:45.750 --> 32:47.550
must be within these four worlds.

32:48.000 --> 32:49.590
We'll find it faster if we split up.

32:51.590 --> 32:52.350
Anyway,

32:52.510 --> 32:53.200
I can't escape from here.

32:54.000 --> 32:54.880
Count me in.

32:58.040 --> 32:59.370
Each of us will carry a golden talisman

32:59.790 --> 33:01.270
and enter one of these four worlds.

33:01.880 --> 33:02.920
Once you find Dun Tian

33:02.920 --> 33:03.750
and the Three Thousand Realms Tower,

33:03.920 --> 33:04.830
light the talisman to signal.

33:05.520 --> 33:06.210
Since this is just the infancy

33:06.240 --> 33:07.270
of the new world,

33:07.800 --> 33:08.560
we should be able

33:08.590 --> 33:09.680
to break through the space and reunite.

33:14.030 --> 33:14.750
If anyone

33:15.160 --> 33:15.790
encounters danger,

33:15.810 --> 33:17.020
we must not act on our own.

33:17.240 --> 33:18.310
Always report first, then plan afterward.

33:21.200 --> 33:22.070
You must be careful,

33:42.640 --> 33:43.240
Ranran!

33:47.110 --> 33:47.790
Why are you...

33:48.030 --> 33:48.680
here?

33:49.270 --> 33:50.960
Dun Tian is in my world.

33:51.430 --> 33:52.710
The others have all fallen into his hands.

33:53.160 --> 33:53.830
Come with me now.

33:56.960 --> 33:58.850
Ranran, why are you doing this?

33:59.550 --> 34:00.720
Shui and I agreed

34:00.920 --> 34:01.960
to report first when anything happens.

34:02.440 --> 34:03.920
But you suddenly barged in here.

34:04.240 --> 34:05.510
Clearly, you're an imposter.

34:06.440 --> 34:08.280
Looks like Dun Tian and the Three Thousand Realms Tower

34:08.840 --> 34:10.190
are within my world.

34:11.710 --> 34:13.710
As expected of Mu Qingge.

34:14.070 --> 34:15.190
Clever indeed.

34:16.110 --> 34:16.840
But unfortunately,

34:17.320 --> 34:18.800
you're still going to die here.

34:21.800 --> 34:22.510
Demon's child?

34:23.480 --> 34:24.400
How could he endure the Spirit Spring

34:24.480 --> 34:25.710
while impersonating Shui?

34:26.230 --> 34:26.880
You are...

34:28.550 --> 34:29.280
a shadow person?

34:31.000 --> 34:31.630
That's right.

34:32.280 --> 34:33.190
How could this be?

34:33.670 --> 34:35.280
The shadow people have disappeared.

34:36.000 --> 34:36.840
Why are you...

34:37.230 --> 34:39.020
Since the Two-headed Deceptive Python has two heads,

34:39.800 --> 34:41.330
the first shadow people it created

34:41.360 --> 34:42.110
were two.

34:42.880 --> 34:44.000
One was Wei Jiu,

34:44.280 --> 34:45.480
and the other was me.

34:46.280 --> 34:47.630
As long as we both exist,

34:47.679 --> 34:48.560
the shadow people after us

34:48.590 --> 34:49.840
can be infinitely replicated.

34:50.190 --> 34:51.280
You thought you won

34:51.280 --> 34:52.360
by killing the fake Wei Jiu.

34:56.110 --> 34:56.960
How laughable.

35:01.360 --> 35:02.320
I see.

35:03.190 --> 35:04.960
So those shadow people dissipated

35:05.110 --> 35:06.800
to conceal your existence.

35:09.030 --> 35:10.960
I've replicated everything from Su Yishui,

35:11.510 --> 35:13.030
including the body of the Demon's child.

35:13.660 --> 35:14.950
So naturally, I can absorb the Spirit Spring

35:14.980 --> 35:15.910
and use it for my master.

35:16.670 --> 35:17.400
Mu Qingge,

35:18.280 --> 35:19.840
now you should understand.

35:20.350 --> 35:21.390
It's not impossible

35:21.760 --> 35:22.760
for the Demon Child to kill you!

35:33.800 --> 35:34.550
Shadow people?

35:34.840 --> 35:35.670
When I fell into demonic ways,

35:35.960 --> 35:37.550
Dun Tian led me to summon the Two-headed Deceptive Python.

35:37.950 --> 35:39.660
So that was his plan for me all along.

35:49.840 --> 35:50.670
He was prepared from the start,

35:50.880 --> 35:51.760
intending to trap us.

35:53.670 --> 35:54.880
The Tainted Demonic Serpent Formation has formed.

35:55.280 --> 35:56.280
It can't be broken in a short time.

35:58.070 --> 35:59.110
Stay here obediently

35:59.800 --> 36:01.400
and wait for the opening of the Three Thousand Realms.

36:04.510 --> 36:05.030
Tu Jiuyuan,

36:05.230 --> 36:05.880
are you alright?

36:08.550 --> 36:09.880
You bullied my people?

36:10.280 --> 36:11.140
You're seeking death!

36:28.280 --> 36:29.000
Wei Jiu!

36:49.400 --> 36:50.030
Wei Jiu!

36:54.480 --> 36:55.320
You're nothing.

37:01.070 --> 37:02.190
I won't die.

37:04.960 --> 37:06.000
I will...

37:06.880 --> 37:08.320
get you out of here soon.

37:19.280 --> 37:20.070
Back then,

37:20.440 --> 37:21.550
I used the Blood-bound Net

37:21.550 --> 37:22.480
to trap you two.

37:22.910 --> 37:24.390
I can sacrifice my own blood

37:24.760 --> 37:25.960
and try it again!

37:26.760 --> 37:27.800
It will only last for a moment.

37:28.670 --> 37:29.320
Don't...

37:29.800 --> 37:30.800
miss it.

37:51.360 --> 37:52.070
Wei Jiu!

38:01.840 --> 38:03.190
The Demon's child is so precious.

38:03.800 --> 38:05.000
How could I bear to release him

38:05.030 --> 38:06.000
and let you kill him?

38:06.030 --> 38:07.070
He is just a shadow

38:07.090 --> 38:08.210
projected by a space

38:08.440 --> 38:10.040
I created.

38:10.370 --> 38:11.480
Since you're here,

38:12.630 --> 38:13.960
then come out and meet me.

38:18.280 --> 38:19.670
This damn Dun Tian.

38:21.360 --> 38:22.920
He made me, a dignified demon lord,

38:23.760 --> 38:25.190
sacrifice myself for others.

38:26.070 --> 38:26.440
How...

38:27.000 --> 38:27.880
How embarrassing.

38:28.370 --> 38:29.510
Wei Jiu is severely injured.

38:30.070 --> 38:31.070
I need to sustain his energy

38:31.070 --> 38:31.840
to heal him.

38:32.360 --> 38:33.510
You must stop Dun Tian.

38:34.360 --> 38:34.800
Alright.

38:55.280 --> 38:56.230
Long time no see.

38:57.540 --> 38:58.830
You don't need to look at me like that.

38:59.800 --> 39:00.590
Su Yishui,

39:01.870 --> 39:03.020
I've been planning this for years.

39:03.650 --> 39:05.380
Among all my pawns,

39:05.800 --> 39:07.190
you are the most disobedient one.

39:08.160 --> 39:09.160
I painstakingly built

39:09.190 --> 39:10.320
countless steps,

39:11.000 --> 39:13.190
and yet you refuse to step on them.

39:13.710 --> 39:15.280
You're so annoying.

39:18.400 --> 39:19.230
Very well.

39:22.550 --> 39:23.440
My whole life

39:23.760 --> 39:24.960
has been burdened by your schemes.

39:25.550 --> 39:27.190
But at least I didn't give you what you want.

39:27.710 --> 39:28.840
If I can cause you some trouble,

39:29.550 --> 39:30.480
that's good enough.

39:32.920 --> 39:34.230
This is your nature.

39:35.030 --> 39:35.840
I've figured it out.

39:36.070 --> 39:36.840
It's impossible

39:37.000 --> 39:38.510
to make you change.

39:38.920 --> 39:40.000
The only way

39:41.140 --> 39:42.460
is to create a new version of you.

39:45.030 --> 39:45.710
Finally,

39:46.980 --> 39:48.500
I have your shadow person.

39:53.630 --> 39:55.550
When you destroyed your Golden Core

39:55.960 --> 39:57.710
and separated from the Spirit Spring for Ranran,

39:58.150 --> 39:59.150
I knew

40:00.360 --> 40:01.510
I had succeeded.

40:02.320 --> 40:03.360
I know that Uncle Ye Xin

40:03.360 --> 40:04.440
is just your false form.

40:04.960 --> 40:06.070
But even so,

40:06.970 --> 40:07.770
I've always remembered

40:07.800 --> 40:08.760
the favor of your upbringing.

40:11.400 --> 40:12.510
You were born in this world,

40:12.760 --> 40:13.710
grew up in this world,

40:14.190 --> 40:15.360
and the memories you're longing for

40:15.590 --> 40:16.710
also originated from this world.

40:17.190 --> 40:18.630
I'll advise you one last time.

40:19.550 --> 40:20.400
Please stop.

40:21.070 --> 40:21.800
Advise me?

40:22.670 --> 40:23.400
Mu Qingge,

40:23.880 --> 40:24.760
if it weren't for you,

40:24.760 --> 40:25.840
I would have reunited with my wife

40:25.840 --> 40:27.150
and children over a decade ago.

40:27.320 --> 40:28.190
If it weren't for you,

40:28.210 --> 40:29.190
Su Yishui wouldn't have

40:29.190 --> 40:30.320
become such a problem.

40:31.920 --> 40:32.590
Yet

40:33.280 --> 40:34.480
you've always wanted to repay the favor

40:34.510 --> 40:35.670
of my upbringing.

40:36.280 --> 40:37.600
But I regret it

40:37.630 --> 40:38.550
every moment.

40:38.970 --> 40:39.890
I regret that at that time

40:39.920 --> 40:40.840
I had a whim

40:40.880 --> 40:41.630
and decided to raise you.

40:44.630 --> 40:46.000
But it's all over now.

40:46.960 --> 40:48.230
It will be over soon.

40:48.920 --> 40:50.670
The Three Thousand Realms Tower is about to form.

40:51.230 --> 40:52.190
By then,

40:52.920 --> 40:54.630
I will go and seek my fulfillment.

40:55.110 --> 40:55.960
And you

40:56.400 --> 40:58.280
will face your demise!

41:10.360 --> 41:10.920
Be careful!

41:11.190 --> 41:11.880
Here it comes again!

42:17.370 --> 42:18.080
I will protect you!

42:21.140 --> 42:23.430
One wisp of qi to break the galaxy!

42:26.970 --> 42:29.260
One wisp of qi to break the galaxy!

42:45.110 --> 42:45.880
How did this happen?

42:46.920 --> 42:48.000
With our combined attack,

42:48.410 --> 42:49.290
even an immortal

42:49.320 --> 42:49.670
couldn't

42:49.670 --> 42:50.710
heal immediately after being injured.

42:51.440 --> 42:52.070
Unless...

42:52.550 --> 42:53.710
this isn't his true form!

42:58.750 --> 42:59.580
In this painting,

43:00.050 --> 43:01.130
there's a figure under the tower.

43:02.800 --> 43:04.430
The painting we saw in the Celestial Sect.

43:05.190 --> 43:06.030
Forming the tower with a mortal body?

43:06.690 --> 43:07.930
Dun Tian is using his own mortal body

43:07.960 --> 43:08.960
to form the Three Thousand Realms Tower.

43:09.420 --> 43:10.900
No wonder, even though we destroyed the tower's core,

43:11.330 --> 43:12.160
he was easily able

43:12.190 --> 43:13.320
to move it to Mount Wester.

43:14.920 --> 43:15.760
That's right.

43:16.510 --> 43:17.320
All of this

43:17.840 --> 43:19.590
is thanks to you.

43:32.390 --> 43:33.470
I am the tower,

43:34.000 --> 43:34.960
and the tower is me.

43:36.400 --> 43:37.990
What do you have to defeat me?
